Usage: greet [options] WHO...
    -v, --[no-]verbose               Say more
    -n, --name NAME                  Who greets
    -c, --count N                    How many times
        --level LEVEL                Select level (low, high)
level high
["Bob", "Carol"]
{verbose: true, name: "Ann", count: 2, level: :high}
true
"Ann"
2
["Eve"]
["--no-verbose", "-nDee", "Eve"]
{verbose: false, name: "Dee"}
{"a" => true, "c" => "3", "long" => nil}
OptionParser::InvalidOption: invalid option: --bogus
OptionParser::InvalidArgument: invalid argument: --count x
OptionParser::MissingArgument: missing argument: --name
OptionParser::NeedlessArgument: needless argument: --verbose=yes
[]
[]
